 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-casesusedasexternalpackaging" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-casesusedasexternalpackaging" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="casesusedasexternalpackaging-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If a musical instrument case or suitcase is used as outer packaging, the case itself won’t be covered. If you’re sending clothes in a suitcase, please pack your items in strong outer packaging if you’d like the case to be covered in addition to the contents.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Please note that internal damage to appliances, mechanical items or electronics is excluded from compensation.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="documentation-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-documentation" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-documentation" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Documentation -open answer" data-test-id="documentation-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="documentation-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Documentation </span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>